# pos_auto_takeoff.scn — POS_HOLD ARM-triggered auto-takeoff to the target altitude
#                        POS_HOLD の ARM トリガ自動離陸（目標高度まで）   (redesign 2026-06-14)
#
# Same chain as alt_auto_takeoff.scn but in POS_HOLD: ARM triggers the auto-takeoff
# (no throttle), the climb HOLDS THE LAUNCH POINT horizontally (the position cascade
# runs during the climb with the launch capture), and the craft parks over the spot it
# took off from. The climb captures the 0.5 m TARGET (decision ②), not the overshoot peak.
# alt_auto_takeoff.scn と同じ連鎖を POS_HOLD で: ARM が自動離陸をトリガ（スロットルなし）、
# 上昇中は「発進点の水平保持」も行い（上昇中も位置カスケードが発進点捕捉で動く）、離陸地点の
# 真上で停止する。上昇は 0.5 m 目標を捕捉する（確定②、行き過ぎピークでなく）。
#
# Run: sf sil scenario simulator/sil/scenarios/pos_auto_takeoff.scn --target vehicle
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — still calibration completes (~4 s)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        0     0     1  # B: POS switch ON while DISARMED → ground mode change
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        0     0     1  # C: ARM in POS_HOLD — props stop, spool, AUTO-takeoff fires (throttle ignored)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     8000      50        0     0     1  # D: throttle at CENTER (2048 = spring rest = HOLD) → climb to 0.5 m, hold altitude + launch point
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     200       50                       # E: release ARM button
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     200       50                       # F: press again → DISARM (toggle)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     600       50                       # G: settle disarmed
